1
00:00:43,210 --> 00:00:46,533
=Born Again=

2
00:00:46,533 --> 00:00:49,558
=Episode 4=

3
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,969
Gu Xiaotang,

4
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:06,400
have you no shame?

5
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:42,579
Shut up!

6
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:28,280
Isn't that Gu Xiaotang?

7
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:29,520
Who's that guy next to her?

8
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:31,160
See? They're holding hands.

9
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:33,840
Isn't Gu Xiaotang getting married?

10
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,204
Could he be the other man?

11
00:02:44,600 --> 00:02:46,372
It was urgent just now.

12
00:02:46,372 --> 00:02:47,441
- I...
- No...

13
00:02:51,200 --> 00:02:53,640
So, well...
Do you have any more lollipops?

14
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,448
No.

15
00:03:02,240 --> 00:03:03,259
It's okay.

16
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,669
I'll just faint then.

17
00:03:05,480 --> 00:03:06,880
So next,

18
00:03:08,360 --> 00:03:09,564
where are we going?

19
00:03:13,200 --> 00:03:15,920
So we've broken the loop?

20
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,000
I'm at your place now.

21
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:21,680
It should be safe, right?

22
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,200
Unless

23
00:03:27,840 --> 00:03:29,880
you're the mastermind behind all this.

24
00:03:40,440 --> 00:03:41,680
These blueberries are too sour.

25
00:03:45,160 --> 00:03:46,297
Why are you looking at me?

26
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:49,680
I'll go make you a salad.

27
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:07,960
(Did I trust him too easily?)

28
00:04:08,440 --> 00:04:10,200
(Your left waist wound
hasn't healed right.)

29
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:11,720
No heavy exercise yet.

30
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,360
Here.

31
00:04:13,360 --> 00:04:14,600
Aren't you hypoglycemic?

32
00:04:15,640 --> 00:04:17,760
(How does he know
I had a waist reduction surgery?)

33
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:20,360
(And that I'm prone to hypoglycemia?)

34
00:04:20,840 --> 00:04:22,314
(That's so weird.)

35
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,200
(So many lollipops.)

36
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,240
Do you usually

37
00:04:41,640 --> 00:04:42,640
like to eat candy?

38
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:44,672
No, I don't.

39
00:05:11,529 --> 00:05:15,228
(Body Textbook)

40
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,080
(This is...)

41
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:27,800
(Could it be
that I was his target from the start?)

42
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,720
(He couldn't be trying to...)

43
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:39,400
Mei, I'll give you an address.
Come pick me up.

44
00:05:39,800 --> 00:05:40,899
What are you doing?

45
00:05:44,052 --> 00:05:45,089
Stay back!

46
00:05:45,089 --> 00:05:47,600
- Xiaotang, what's wrong? What happened?
- Don't follow me!

47
00:05:47,771 --> 00:05:49,738
I'll smash you, you creep!

48
00:05:49,738 --> 00:05:50,960
- I'll kill you!
- Xiaotang!

49
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:52,160
- Are you misunderstanding something?
- Peeping Tom!

50
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,190
Stalker!

51
00:05:53,703 --> 00:05:54,793
I'll kill you!

52
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,932
Why are you looking at me?

53
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,480
Do you want to take a photo too?

54
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:32,760
Let's take a photo together.

55
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,760
Look at the camera.

56
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:35,760
Three, two, one.

57
00:06:35,760 --> 00:06:36,800
Cheese!

58
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:47,600
Why not look at the camera?

59
00:06:49,520 --> 00:06:50,592
It's yours.

60
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:53,560
When I become
a shining superstar someday,

61
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,000
this will be a collector's edition.

62
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:58,170
Homework's on you today.

63
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:09,000
Ye Shen.

64
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,440
Not my fault I didn't recognize you.

65
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:12,200
It's mainly your fault.

66
00:07:12,200 --> 00:07:13,560
You've just changed so much.

67
00:07:14,240 --> 00:07:16,040
Back in school,

68
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,320
you didn't talk much.

69
00:07:18,320 --> 00:07:20,400
I even thought you might be mute.

70
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:23,600
But now,

71
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,560
you can fight,

72
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,496
and even kiss.

73
00:07:29,320 --> 00:07:31,000
It's so misleading.

74
00:07:31,360 --> 00:07:32,360
You...

75
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,640
Stop drinking.

76
00:07:36,880 --> 00:07:37,960
Wait.

77
00:07:40,200 --> 00:07:41,240
You...

78
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:58,159
Does it hurt?

79
00:07:59,520 --> 00:08:01,493
I didn't hold back.

80
00:08:03,640 --> 00:08:04,960
It's all bruised.

81
00:08:06,280 --> 00:08:07,350
It's fine.

82
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:11,604
Ye Shen,

83
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:12,960
I haven't even asked...

84
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:20,000
You haven't answered me yet.

85
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,720
Tell me.

86
00:08:22,720 --> 00:08:26,840
After I dropped out of high school
to become a trainee,

87
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,840
we haven't met since, right?

88
00:08:32,640 --> 00:08:33,680
So today,

89
00:08:33,680 --> 00:08:35,560
why did you show up at my wedding?

90
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:38,240
Just passing by.

91
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,920
It looked lively, so I...

92
00:08:39,920 --> 00:08:41,475
Passing by?

93
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,253
Passing by.

94
00:08:46,800 --> 00:08:47,973
Still got chemistry.

95
00:08:48,840 --> 00:08:49,993
We

96
00:08:50,560 --> 00:08:52,600
were high school classmates,

97
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:53,680
and now we're

98
00:08:53,680 --> 00:08:55,280
trapped in this loop together.

99
00:08:55,560 --> 00:08:57,040
We've got chemistry, right?

100
00:09:41,040 --> 00:09:42,400
Actually, I wasn't passing by.

101
00:09:43,040 --> 00:09:44,320
I wanted to see

102
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:47,080
if the girl
who wanted a perfect life back then

103
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:49,520
had her wish fulfilled.

104
00:09:51,560 --> 00:09:53,000
(In the future,)

105
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:55,880
I will definitely become
the most famous superstar in the world,

106
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:57,240
and have a perfect life.

107
00:09:57,800 --> 00:09:58,800
Believe it or not?

108
00:10:01,680 --> 00:10:02,818
I do.

109
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:05,735
(Later on,)

110
00:10:05,800 --> 00:10:07,616
- (I heard about you dropping out.)
- Did you hear?

111
00:10:07,616 --> 00:10:09,000
Gu Xiaotang dropped out.

112
00:10:09,049 --> 00:10:11,560
I heard she's going
to be some kind of star.

113
00:10:11,920 --> 00:10:13,965
She's just going to work to make money.

114
00:10:14,320 --> 00:10:15,720
I heard her mom is sick.

115
00:10:15,720 --> 00:10:17,840
She signed a ten-year contract
with a talent agency.

116
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:22,920
(Seven years passed)

117
00:10:23,560 --> 00:10:24,880
(before I saw you again.)

118
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:29,000
Look, is that Gu Xiaotang?

119
00:10:29,640 --> 00:10:30,640
I bought her products.

120
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:32,200
She's an influencer now.

121
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,929
(After all these years,)

122
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,320
(you haven't changed much.)

123
00:10:36,000 --> 00:10:37,766
(Still as clever as ever.)

124
00:10:39,455 --> 00:10:40,640
Use it for three months,

125
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:42,000
and my skin's so dewy and plump.

126
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,280
A true all-nighter savior.

127
00:10:43,280 --> 00:10:44,360
Sensitive skin friendly.

128
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,480
And today

129
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,492
we have an amazing deal on this one.

130
00:10:47,492 --> 00:10:49,120
Buy one, get one free.

131
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,320
We'll have more benefits for you.

132
00:10:51,320 --> 00:10:53,200
So that's all for today's livestream.

133
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,385
(Two more hours of streaming)
Almost...

134
00:10:55,560 --> 00:10:57,760
I see there's a product

135
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:59,040
we haven't shared with you all.

136
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,200
(Though everyone keeps saying)

137
00:11:01,520 --> 00:11:02,920
(nobody hustles harder than you,)

138
00:11:03,200 --> 00:11:04,760
(I always feel like you're exhausted)

139
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,697
(and upset.)

140
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:10,235
(Because when you're unset,
you rub your ears.)

141
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:14,819
(Later on,)

142
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:17,160
(I heard that you were getting married.)

143
00:11:18,047 --> 00:11:20,560
(Gu Xiaotang and Lu Qingyuan)
I really want to know if you're happy.

144
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:22,480
(Did you marry someone you love?)

145
00:11:23,760 --> 00:11:24,960
So,

146
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:26,405
I sneaked in.

147
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:35,600
What... What's wrong?

148
00:11:37,480 --> 00:11:38,720
How did I almost fall asleep?

149
00:11:39,160 --> 00:11:40,437
No.

150
00:11:42,040 --> 00:11:43,040
I need to go home now.

151
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:44,573
You forgot?

152
00:11:44,573 --> 00:11:46,320
Once I fall asleep,
the loop will restart.

153
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:48,320
- I'm going home.
- You are okay?

154
00:11:48,880 --> 00:11:49,917
I'm fine.

155
00:11:51,200 --> 00:11:52,600
Just now when I fell asleep,

156
00:11:52,600 --> 00:11:54,520
I vaguely heard you talking to me.

157
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:55,710
What did you say?

158
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,034
I didn't say anything.

159
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:01,320
I need to go home now.

160
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:03,896
I'll see you off then.

161
00:12:27,238 --> 00:12:30,594
♪The face deep in the heart♪

162
00:12:30,786 --> 00:12:33,248
♪Suddenly clear and hazy♪

163
00:12:34,623 --> 00:12:38,323
♪Across time and space, eyes meet again♪

164
00:12:38,534 --> 00:12:40,974
♪Deeply trapped in the vortex♪

165
00:12:41,121 --> 00:12:43,493
♪Searching for familiar outlines♪

166
00:12:43,643 --> 00:12:46,400
♪Persistently guarding,
endlessly cycling♪

167
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:48,721
♪Even for just a second♪

168
00:12:50,066 --> 00:12:53,529
♪If raindrops flow backward
into the sky♪

169
00:12:53,657 --> 00:12:55,506
♪And sunlight reverses♪

170
00:12:55,506 --> 00:12:58,976
♪As the sun rises and sets,
we reunite with yesterday♪

171
00:12:59,332 --> 00:13:01,406
♪I'll build a dream with you♪

172
00:13:01,908 --> 00:13:05,317
♪Upon the ruins, spring breeze arrives♪

173
00:13:05,574 --> 00:13:10,786
♪Even if there's no end,
I won't regret the start♪

174
00:13:12,040 --> 00:13:14,605
♪Eternity like a day, rushing to you♪

175
00:13:14,647 --> 00:13:18,100
♪You don't need to recognize my eyes♪

176
00:13:18,677 --> 00:13:21,640
♪Following the tracks
of the days that were♪

177
00:13:22,385 --> 00:13:24,993
♪A day like a lifetime, rushing to you♪

178
00:13:24,993 --> 00:13:28,616
♪You don't need to remember my name♪

179
00:13:29,086 --> 00:13:33,142
♪I'll be the dawn you haven't seen♪
